# The recursion of a function of attractors/kind: a Scott sum of three
# constructors, in order: none, the function does not recur;
# self_application, it recurs through its own copy applied to itself;
# fixpoint, through the prelude's fixed point combinator. Read by its
# position (gezi.contest.corpora.claims.Attractors, AttractorRecursion).
λ export
. export
  (λnone self_application fixpoint. none)
  (λnone self_application fixpoint. self_application) λnone self_application fixpoint. fixpoint
